direction_521 = location "Spoiler" about "Spoiler\nBird monsters endowed with power by Pathos`s evil energy" found "Moradon" at 429 614 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, there's a rumor going about that Rage is handing out great treasure... Let's go and check if its true or not."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Ha ha, so you heard the rumor? Well, I found some armor and a weapon and I'm going to give 'em away. But not for free, as a reward for some hard work. So I'm giving a nice pair of boots to the one who hunts 10 Spoilers in the shortest time."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Want to give it a shot? You should be able to pull it off.\n\nIf you heed [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage's request you can obtain craft items as a reward."

On in_progress
    Say "I told you to bring me 10!"

On ready
    Say "Yes!! Now the treasure is all ours- I mean yours, master!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "My intuition never fails.. You are well qualified to wear the boots. Hope they will come to good use."
